{"id": "DeKFBr0vRpv", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CLAUDE\" to get all these 5 AI plugins to level up your Claude Code.\n\nDon't use Claude Code until you've installed these five plugins.\n\nFirst is FreeLLMAPI.\n\nIt gives your Claude Code over 7 billion free AI tokens from 600+ AI models.\n\nIt automatically switches you to the next best model whenever your usage limit runs out.\n\nSecond is Strix.\n\nIt attacks your vibe coded app like a real hacker.\n\nIt finds and fixes any security vulnerabilities left behind.\n\nThird is Claude Mem.\n\nIt gives your Claude memory across every session.\n\nIt remembers your project and files without you ever having to re-explain anything.\n\nFourth is Agent Reach.\n\nIt lets you scrape anything off the internet.\n\nEven gated platforms like LinkedIn, Instagram, X, and Reddit.\n\nWithout paying for anything.\n\nAnd finally, there's Claude Code Setup.\n\nIt's an official Anthropic plugin.\n\nIt scans your codebase and recommends the best skills, hooks, sub agents and MCP servers for your project.\n\nTogether, they fix the biggest problems most people hit with Claude Code.\n\nUsage limits, security gaps, lost context, missing data, and a messy setup.\n\nThink of it like giving your Claude Code a full upgrade pack.\n\nEach one fills a gap most Claude Code users never think about.\n\n#claudecode #aiplugins #freellmapi #agentreach #strixai", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1791299644, "like_count": 4858, "comment_count": 5307, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2320377475460512a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.782, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOUFcZsn4BRAIawuPF-VDyQhmwW_AOE3rMn43yq6khtVcqN_wH1sZuyVHeITuMbwmk3StS0WKBKFroDNOxXtnnA_awO-dfsCzK3cuU.mp4?_n